      "content": "[별지 제 4호 서식]\n\n(앞쪽)\n┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓\nPERSONAL INFORMATION                                            ┃[PHOTO]                       ┃\n┃(3㎝×4㎝)                    ┃\n* FOR OFFICIAL USE ONLY                                         ┃                              ┃\n┏━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━━━━━┯━━━━━┯━━━━━━┩                              ┃\n┃FULL NAME         │Last/First/Middle │DATE OF   │Month/Day/Year│                              ┃\n┃                  │                  │BIRTH     │            │                              ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┼─────┼──────┤                              ┃\n┃NATIONALITY       │                  │PLACE OF  │City/Country│                              ┃\n┃(include any      │                  │ BIRTH    │            │                              ┃\n┃dual nationality) │                  │          │            │                              ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┼─────┼──────┴───────────────┨\n┃FOREIGNER         │                  │DATE&     │Month/Day/Year       City/Country           ┃\n┃REGISTRATION      │                  │PLACE YOU │                                            ┃\n┃NUMBER            │                  │ENTERED   │                                            ┃\n┃                  │                  │KOREA     │                                            ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┴─────┴┬──────┬──────────────┨\n┃ADDRESS           │                                │GENDER      │                            ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┬──────┼──────┼──────────────┨\n┃WORK PLACE        │                  │JOB/POSITION│            │                            ┃\n┠─────────┼─────────┴──────┴──────┴──────────────┨\n┃TELEPHONE         │ HOME :                  WORK :                  MOBILE :                   ┃\n┃NUMBERS           │                                                                            ┃\n┃(Include Area     │                                                                            ┃\n┃code)      